schema 恢复，--resume）\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 12 / 负向 0 / 失败 0 / 共 13\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-16980: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- mvp_phase0_docred_schema_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1767, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Re8eUb7AVMNGK6yAKhvumm","session_id":"d3f277a6-e3f2-4896-b0ab-b981dcb5dabb","uuid":"9369493a-b2cd-4434-bc2f-6fb6cd065559","timestamp":"2026-05-14T10:43:50.913Z"}
